      "content": "It sounds incredibly disheartening to feel like thirty years of dedication are being overshadowed by rapid technological change. Please remember that your mastery isn't just about the tasks themselves, but the deep skill, knowledge, and perspective you've cultivated. Your experience holds a unique value that automation simply cannot replicate, and you are far from just taking up space.",
